{"3139570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Co-op Kaiju Horror Cooking", "steam_appid": 3139570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/13f2767d6eeef5c039d1a9d89dcf098a.avif?t=1766070019\" width=1200 height=100 /></span><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. <br><br>You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1766070019\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.webm?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.mp4?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't stay in the Larder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.poster.avif?t=1766070019\" aria-label=\"Gif showing monks running around a huge room filled with stairs and columns\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.webm?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.mp4?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Flexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/723fc277796e97032bd7229a9db49a5f.avif?t=1766070019\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/13f2767d6eeef5c039d1a9d89dcf098a.avif?t=1766070019\" width=1200 height=100 /></span><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. <br><br>You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1766070019\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.webm?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.mp4?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't stay in the Larder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.poster.avif?t=1766070019\" aria-label=\"Gif showing monks running around a huge room filled with stairs and columns\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.webm?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.mp4?t=1766070019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Flexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/723fc277796e97032bd7229a9db49a5f.avif?t=1766070019\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p>", "short_description": "In this absurd co-op horror game you are medieval monks--and the only chefs who can prevent the apocalypse. Feed enormous monsters with a catapult, evade supernatural enemies, and navigate a reality-bending labyrinth with up to 4+ players!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/e39a5192345e018d461b937e628a3ef39cf6d81a/header.jpg?t=1766070019", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/cf4afba67616387f07961e610f1c64a7044eacbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766070019", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/cf4afba67616387f07961e610f1c64a7044eacbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766070019", "website": "https://www.strangescaffold.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350 or higher, or versions 2004 and 20H2 revision .789 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB or more<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> please</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:<